    {
      "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"section-heading\"><span class=\"section-number\">06</span><h2>人際打聽</h2></div><div class=\"question-heading\"><h3>我願意嘗試</h3><span class=\"answer-mode\">可複選</span></div><div class=\"choices choices-stacked\"><label class=\"choice\" for=\"ep89-ask-a\"><input id=\"ep89-ask-a\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>傳訊息給一位已經畢業的學長姐請教心得</span></label><label class=\"choice\" for=\"ep89-ask-b\"><input id=\"ep89-ask-b\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>聽一集跟職業訪談有關的 Podcast</span></label><div class=\"choice other-choice\"><label class=\"choice-toggle\" for=\"ep89-ask-other\"><input id=\"ep89-ask-other\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>我自己的選項</span></label><input class=\"other-input\" id=\"ep89-ask-other-text\" type=\"text\" aria-label=\"人際打聽的自訂選項\"></div></div><p class=\"example-note\">例如：先寫下想請教學長姐的一個問題。</p>\n<div class=\"section-heading\"><span class=\"section-number\">07</span><h2>現實評估</h2></div><div class=\"question-heading\"><h3>我願意嘗試</h3><span class=\"answer-mode\">可複選</span></div><div class=\"choices choices-stacked\"><label class=\"choice\" for=\"ep89-reality-a\"><input id=\"ep89-reality-a\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>記帳一週，算出自己每個月最少要花多少錢</span></label><label class=\"choice\" for=\"ep89-reality-b\"><input id=\"ep89-reality-b\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>上網查詢這份工作大概的「起薪」是多少</span></label><div class=\"choice other-choice\"><label class=\"choice-toggle\" for=\"ep89-reality-other\"><input id=\"ep89-reality-other\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>我自己的選項</span></label><input class=\"other-input\" id=\"ep89-reality-other-text\" type=\"text\" aria-label=\"現實評估的自訂選項\"></div></div><p class=\"example-note\">例如：先列出每月固定要付的費用。</p>\n<div class=\"section-heading\"><span class=\"section-number\">08</span><h2>心態建設</h2></div><div class=\"question-heading\"><h3>我願意嘗試</h3><span class=\"answer-mode\">可複選</span></div><div class=\"choices choices-stacked\"><label class=\"choice\" for=\"ep89-mindset-a\"><input id=\"ep89-mindset-a\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>告訴自己：第一份工作不代表一輩子</span></label><label class=\"choice\" for=\"ep89-mindset-b\"><input id=\"ep89-mindset-b\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>告訴自己：每個人都有自己的時鐘，不用跟人比</span></label><div class=\"choice other-choice\"><label class=\"choice-toggle\" for=\"ep89-mindset-other\"><input id=\"ep89-mindset-other\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>我自己的選項</span></label><input class=\"other-input\" id=\"ep89-mindset-other-text\" type=\"text\" aria-label=\"心態建設的自訂選項\"></div></div><p class=\"example-note\">例如：把「我現在只需要試出下一步」寫在筆記裡。</p>",
      "footer": "大谷翔平也在用的「九宮格思考法」｜讓夢想變成計畫，你就是下一個傳奇"
